    ('ubud-home-massage-service-ubud', '4835fcf0c6a8be3dfea4b0ef5e9669c3', 'Ubud Home Massage Service is a wellness spa in Ubud with 20 treatments, from traditional massage and foot massage to spa packages. Treatments run up to two hours, and bookings go through WhatsApp.'),
    ('ubud-sari-spa-ubud', 'db59e9b2d9436d8741e031efaa4901a1', 'A spa in Ubud with 17 treatments, including a body scrub, traditional massage and a neck and shoulder treatment. The Ubud Sari Signature Massage is 250K IDR for an hour, and the longest treatment runs five hours. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('ubud-village-resort-spa-ubud', 'ced82dcf152ec2fd441770252e6125ea', 'Ubud Village Resort & Spa has a resort spa in Ubud with four treatments, traditional and Balinese massage among them. Treatments run up to two hours, and you book on the resort''s own website.'),
    ('villa-sonia-ubud-ubud', '87ba6cf6495df7cb8b466d41e15bb2de', 'Villa Sonia Ubud is a wellness spa in Ubud with four items on its list, a Balinese massage among them. Booking is on the venue''s own website.'),
    ('vita-healing-massage-spa-ubud', '3b182f4040d3b59a84d5dfa5d4b2a103', 'There are 89 treatments on the list at Vita Healing Massage Spa, a massage studio in Ubud. They range from traditional massage and cupping to spa packages, and the longest treatment runs 165 minutes.'),
    ('anantara-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'dd20365a29c45a82d8749db873222818', 'In the Bukit, Anantara Spa is a day spa with 11 treatments, from traditional and Balinese massage to deep tissue. An hour of foot reflexology costs 750K IDR, and booking is on the spa''s own website. The longest treatment runs two and a half hours.'),
    ('atmos-bodylab-uluwatu-bukit', '9e960e15d0e812beb3dec15e7767482b', 'ATMOS BodyLab, a wellness spa in the Bukit, keeps eight treatments on its list, from traditional massage and deep tissue to recovery. A 60-minute relaxation massage costs 700K IDR, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('ayana-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'cdecac3c39d4d426ec23d61040b3baa7', 'AYANA Spa in the Bukit has 23 treatments, with reflexology alongside traditional and Balinese massage. Treatments run up to three hours, and bookings are taken by WhatsApp.'),
    ('bali-bliss-massage-uluwatu-bukit', 'b77877dedba5f84b2944d9f612e5d3b0', 'Bali Bliss Massage is a massage studio in the Bukit with 22 treatments, including Balinese massage, deep tissue and aromatherapy. A head, neck & shoulder treatment costs 250K IDR, and booking is on the studio''s own website.'),
    ('bali-surfing-camp-uluwatu-bukit', '0172ee1c40a0d956a452328aa2459681', 'Bali Surfing Camp runs a wellness centre in the Bukit with 16 items on the list, from yoga and meditation to traditional massage. Booking is on the camp''s own website.'),
    ('bali-yoga-uluwatu-bukit', '51d6313545bd14023298be10faddddfb', 'Bali Yoga is a yoga studio in the Bukit whose 16 items run from yoga and meditation to a manicure. You book on the studio''s own website.'),
    ('body-studio-bali-uluwatu-bukit', '99a6df184c7f76615330dd0b72bf5cd8', 'Body wraps, body treatments and an ice bath are among the 15 items at Body Studio Bali, a spa in the Bukit. The longest treatment lasts four hours, and booking is on the studio''s own website.'),
    ('d-nailbar-uluwatu-bukit', '479bcf1074b3546fb26a0e67cf22e194', U&'Lashes, brows and traditional massage are all on the list at D\2019Nailbar, a beauty salon in the Bukit with 34 treatments. A foot massage costs 115K IDR and the longest treatment runs two hours. You book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('flex-flow-uluwatu-bukit', '2f583d5db38d89e78b6d8a7a3ac285aa', 'Lymphatic massage, sports massage and cupping are on the seven-item list at Flex & Flow, a wellness spa in the Bukit. The Sport Massage Bali is 400K IDR for 60 minutes, booked on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('fresh-beauty-lounge-uluwatu-bukit', '546ad54ca295a74ea3e9d81fa6b9dac4', 'Fresh Beauty Lounge, a wellness spa in the Bukit, does 30 treatments, from facials and body scrubs to head massage. A classic Balinese massage is 475K IDR for 60 minutes, and the longest treatment lasts three and a half hours. Bookings go through WhatsApp.'),
    ('holiday-inn-resort-baruna-bali-tea-tree-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'abab0b9267f3f8ca510d446130b540a2', 'Tea Tree Spa is the day spa at Holiday Inn Resort Baruna Bali, in the Bukit. Its four treatments include Balinese massage, acupressure and a facial, and an hour of Balinese massage is 800K IDR. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('karma-spa-uluwatu-bukit', '44ebaee0a8128ab032369e1bd9e3c73c', 'Karma Spa, a day spa in the Bukit, has 18 treatments, from traditional and Balinese massage to the sauna, the longest treatment lasting three hours. The Signature Royal Massage runs 75 minutes and costs 350K IDR, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('laia-spa-uluwatu-bukit', '8d56c82764fa0ad4508963e8e65e9bf1', 'LaiA Spa is a massage studio in the Bukit, and bookings for its 23 treatments go through WhatsApp. Traditional massage, Balinese massage and deep tissue are among them.'),
    ('luhur-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'caf16ac0ba35841317e17a1f8dc40cad', 'Luhur Spa in the Bukit lists 48 treatments, with foot massage, Balinese massage and spa packages among them; the longest treatment runs four hours. An hour-long head massage costs 210K IDR. To book, message the spa on WhatsApp.'),
    ('oaza-uluwatu-uluwatu-bukit', '5cfaf2a31ec40a14aff4c987524b5fb6', 'A four-hand massage at OAZA Uluwatu, a day spa in the Bukit, costs 470K IDR. The other treatments among its 11 include facials, traditional massage and spa packages. The longest treatment takes 130 minutes, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('our-spa-boutique-bali-uluwatu-bukit', '70c387033caea8eb0317c7eb1cb4285f', 'Facials, hair treatments and traditional massage all feature at Our Spa & Boutique Bali, a day spa in the Bukit with 32 treatments. Booking is on its own website.'),
    ('pandawa-cliff-estate-uluwatu-bukit', '070b6e95fa36bb91d8d65edbfca4bc46', 'At Pandawa Cliff Estate, a wellness spa in the Bukit, the eight treatments include Balinese massage, reflexology and a body scrub. Bookings are made on the estate''s own website.'),
    ('piccolina-bali-uluwatu-bukit', 'd1a4e1660776bdf1dd02c2ac18295191', 'Piccolina Bali is a beauty salon in the Bukit that takes bookings through Fresha. Among its 56 treatments are haircuts, head massage and a neck & shoulder treatment, and the Signature Foot Massage is 120K IDR.'),
    ('professional-massage-uluwatu-uluwatu-bukit', '874c39ee8e9dfd6d1bf8e5aa99de0829', 'Professional Massage Uluwatu, in the Bukit, is a wellness spa with 12 treatments: hot stone, traditional massage and spa packages among them. A traditional Balinese massage is 400K IDR for an hour, booked on the spa''s own website. Treatments run up to two hours.'),
    ('rika-beauty-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'f3deb5546332049bb970187f8c6f8ace', 'An hour of Balinese massage costs 200K IDR at Rika Beauty & Spa, a day spa in the Bukit. Its 22 treatments also include traditional massage and waxing, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('rose-petal-beauty-center-uluwatu-bukit', 'c8f3eda751d37e84617c34ff7aa04636', 'Facials, lashes and haircuts are among the 28 treatments at Rose Petal Beauty Center, a beauty salon in the Bukit. You book through Fresha.'),
    ('salty-face-bali-uluwatu-bukit', 'b309cf3a107e0a8e9681d50ed4858c6b', 'At salty face Bali, a day spa in the Bukit, the 38 treatments include facials, lashes and Balinese massage. A 60-minute Balinese massage costs 345K IDR, and booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('sean-spa-bali-uluwatu-bukit', 'f3acc88777526fad717d93980554a920', 'Sean Spa Bali is a spa in the Bukit with eight treatments on its list, including Balinese massage, deep tissue and hot stone. Bookings go through the spa''s own website.'),
    ('senses-spa-at-biu-biu-resort-uluwatu-bukit', '8841fbcbb8b660c2bcae925873ddcf5e', 'Senses Spa at Biu Biu Resort, in the Bukit, has 33 treatments, among them a couple massage, facials and Balinese massage, and the longest treatment runs two hours. Fifty minutes of reflexology is 400K IDR. Book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('shiki-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'b8170187d22a99d948aa09ff69aff08f', 'Shiki Spa is a day spa in the Bukit with a long list: 77 treatments, among them waxing, lashes and manicures. An hour of foot massage or reflexology costs 150K IDR. The longest treatment runs two hours.'),
    ('sohamsa-ocean-estate-uluwatu-bukit', 'f83aab2dc019bacff53b0d7f466f2e57', 'Sohamsa Ocean Estate in the Bukit runs a spa with four treatments, among them a Balinese massage, reflexology and a body scrub. Booking is on the estate''s own website.'),
    ('spa-shell-uluwatu-bukit', '5a4a3fd544e6c16a03543de0451f79c8', 'Spa Shell is a Bukit spa with 18 treatments, including Balinese massage, deep tissue and reflexology. An hour of Balinese massage costs 220K IDR, and you book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('spring-spa-bingin-uluwatu-bukit', 'e16c3d00c635b0822da183617e366a79', 'Spring Spa Bingin is a spa in the Bukit with six treatments on its list, among them traditional massage, a facial and a foot massage.'),
    ('supernatural-wellbeing-uluwatu-bukit', 'b573088d7c9eb6ee27ed70537f02b073', 'Supernatural Wellbeing is a massage studio in the Bukit with four treatments, among them Swedish, aromatherapy and hot stone massage.'),
    ('the-elysian-uluwatu-bukit', 'f4b0be76907917b38c4277f19c09b3e3', 'The Elysian is a wellness spa in the Bukit with 80 treatments, from facials and body scrubs to traditional massage, the longest treatment lasting three hours. Gel colour on hand or foot nails is 350K IDR for 60 minutes, and bookings go through WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-istana-spa-uluwatu-bukit', '7cc6c09b3f27eb7f0a017aff6cbcdc95', 'The Istana Spa is a day spa in the Bukit with eight items on its list, an ice bath among them; the longest treatment runs three hours. You book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('the-resting-koala-uluwatu-bukit', 'ae8953d08468b09332e3d806f65f1c21', 'The Resting Koala, a day spa in the Bukit, has 20 treatments, including foot massage, Balinese massage and spa packages, the longest treatment lasting two hours. Its Foot Release is 210K IDR for 60 minutes, and bookings go through WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-spa-uluwatu-bukit', 'cf5ca4b1e7031b7c340050438d4a9d4c', 'The Spa, a day spa in the Bukit, lists 30 treatments, including traditional massage, hot stone and spa packages. The longest treatment runs two hours. Booking is on its own website.'),
    ('the-wellness-spa-uluwatu-bukit', '4c439764bd6bf8906a04feea0bf8dbdb', 'With 116 treatments, The Wellness Spa is a day spa in the Bukit that covers traditional massage, facials and waxing, with the longest treatment running four hours. A 60-minute foot massage is 605K IDR; book on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('win-bali-spa-uluwatu-bukit', '4c2e8b3e344e3667fb6f0601eec46866', 'Win Bali Spa is a spa in the Bukit where an hour of foot reflexology costs 180K IDR. Its 20 treatments also take in Balinese massage, traditional massage and a neck and shoulder treatment, and the longest treatment runs two hours.'),
    ('wrong-gym-uluwatu-bukit', '890046c3a8f126a11cad11f479ebd14e', 'Wrong Gym, a wellness centre in the Bukit, has six items on the list, from an ice bath to a sauna and steam.'),
    ('xin-spa-beauty-pecatu-uluwatu-bali-uluwatu-bukit', '636cb0d3e355656e928e23ac4acf3532', 'Nails sit alongside traditional and Balinese massage at Xin Spa Beauty in Pecatu, a day spa in the Bukit with 42 treatments. Bookings are by WhatsApp.'),
    ('zahra-spa-uluwatu-uluwatu-bukit', '6ecb1e881e131fbea0a96b893e41dc67', 'Zahra Spa Uluwatu is a spa in the Bukit with 22 treatments, from traditional and Balinese massage to a neck & shoulder treatment. They run up to two hours. A one-hour body massage for a child costs 245K IDR, booked on the spa''s own website.')
